WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.666
Video fourteen. The Day Book, and the
drill-down to each voucher.

00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:09.317
K opens the Day Book: the vouchers of the
current date, 2 June.

00:00:09.347 --> 00:00:15.764
Particulars shows the ledger of the other side: Cash for a cash
sale. A stock voucher shows its item and the quantity.

00:00:18.347 --> 00:00:22.899
Alt+F2 changes the period: here, from 1 April
to 2 June.

00:00:23.598 --> 00:00:28.748
For a purchase, Particulars shows the
supplier. For a contra, it shows the bank.

00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:34.415
Select a voucher, and press Enter: the voucher
opens.

00:00:35.115 --> 00:00:37.534
Esc goes back to the Day Book.

00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:41.932
Each report starts at the top: here, the
Balance Sheet.

00:00:41.862 --> 00:00:45.679
Enter opens a group, then the next group, then
a ledger.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.961
Then a month, and at the end, the voucher
itself.

00:00:48.891 --> 00:00:51.973
Esc goes back, one level at a time.

00:00:52.273 --> 00:00:55.290
Esc, and B opens the Balance Sheet.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:59.072
Select Current Assets, and press Enter.

00:00:59.102 --> 00:01:03.587
The group opens: the bank, the cash, the stock
and the debtors.

00:01:03.617 --> 00:01:07.167
Enter on Sundry Debtors: the parties who owe
you money.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:11.483
Enter on Sharma Traders: the balance, month by
month.

00:01:12.184 --> 00:01:15.136
Enter on April: the vouchers of the month.

00:01:15.509 --> 00:01:18.927
Enter on the sales voucher: invoice 1 opens.

00:01:19.427 --> 00:01:23.244
Esc goes back one level at a time, to the
Balance Sheet.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:29.497
Next: the Trial Balance, the Profit and Loss
account, and the Balance Sheet.

